    J -->|非法| L[逐条 rejected]
    K --> M[(avatar_telemetry_workflow)]
    K --> N[(avatar_telemetry_invocation)]
    M --> O[统计接口]
    N --> O
    F -->|accepted IDs / rejected| D
    D -->|ACK 对应 revision 更新 upload_status| C
